``` SOC-RULE-050: Phishing Email Reported by a User or Failing DMARC with a Link or Attachment (generated from rules/sigma/email_phishing_reported_or_auth_fail.yml; review before use) ```
index=* (source="*m365:email*") | where ((match('DeliveryAction', "(?i)^Delivered$")) AND (match('ReportedByUser', "(?i)^True$"))) OR ((match('DeliveryAction', "(?i)^Delivered$")) AND (match('AuthenticationResults', "(?i)dmarc=fail")) AND (match('Urls', "(?i)^True$"))) OR ((match('DeliveryAction', "(?i)^Delivered$")) AND (match('AuthenticationResults', "(?i)dmarc=fail")) AND (match('AttachmentSha256', "(?i)^True$")))
